        "min": 3,
        "texto": "Listen first, read afterwards. Next to every letter, word and phrase there is a speaker icon: tap it, listen and repeat aloud. German is written the way it is spoken, and the pronunciation rules are few and regular. In this lesson you hear and read German for the first time: you learn the sounds, read new words without fear and finish with your first greetings. In the tables, «ç» marks the soft «ch» sound (a little like the «h» in «huge») and «rr» marks the harsh, throaty r (nothing like the English r)."
